                    <ref target="frus1945Berlinv02#pg_734">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Ibid.</hi>, p. 734</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d265-f2" n="19" xml:id="d265-f2-content">
                <p>Bulgarian Prime Minister after <hi rendition="#italic">coup d’état</hi>, June
                    1923; convicted <hi rendition="#italic">in absentia</hi> as war criminal.</p>
            </note>
